      "reason": "The diagram yields c=2^a=log_2(b) and d=2^b but gives no numerical anchor. c=2 yields (a,b,c,d)=(1,4,2,16), abcd=128; c=4 yields (2,16,4,65536), abcd=2^23. Thus abcd is not fixed.",
